h(332,"st1 is optimized for sequential throughput, but sustained 500 MiB/s requires a sufficiently large baseline (12.5 TiB under current documentation). A smaller gp3 volume can provision that throughput separately from capacity. Without required capacity, credits, instance bandwidth and prices, the source cannot establish the cheapest option.","cost","Block storage performance","hdd ebs")
