R(416,"BD","resilient","Public subnet connectivity","An attached IGW does not give every new subnet/instance internet reachability; the subnet route and public address are separate prerequisites.",
"EFA is an HPC networking adapter and is not required for internet access.|The subnet's effective route table must send internet traffic to the IGW.|Auto Scaling membership does not determine ordinary internet reachability.|A public IPv4 address is required for this direct IPv4 IGW ingress pattern.|A customer gateway terminates a VPN-side network, not the VPC's ordinary public internet route.","vpc publicip")
R(417,"A","cost","Object retention lifecycle","Lifecycle expiration deletes objects after the configured age without custom cleanup code.",
"An expiration rule automates removal after the intended retention interval.|A bucket policy authorizes requests; it is not an age-based deletion scheduler.|An IAM policy grants/denies actions and does not run periodic deletion.|CORS governs browser cross-origin requests, not automatic object retention.","s3 versioning", "Choose the required day count for 'one month'. Versioned buckets also need appropriate noncurrent-version expiration.")
R(418,"C","cost","TLS & certificates","Use the ALB listener certificate list and SNI to support independent domain certificates on one listener.",
"A SAN certificate must be reissued when its covered names change.|One wildcard cannot cover unrelated registrable domains.|The ALB can choose a matching certificate from its listener list for SNI-capable clients.|Dedicated CloudFront IP support adds cost and is unnecessary for the existing ALB SNI use case.","sni")
