R(508,"A","performance","Streaming fan-out","Kinesis Data Streams provides named enhanced-fan-out consumers with dedicated per-consumer read throughput.",
"Data Streams is the managed record stream with the enhanced-fan-out feature described.|Data Exchange distributes subscribed datasets; it is not the real-time ingestion stream.|MSK supports Kafka patterns but the stated named enhanced-fan-out feature is Kinesis-specific.|S3 Access Points manage object access, not live record ingestion and consumption.","kinesis")
R(509,"AC","cost","Reservation lifecycle","Terminating unneeded compute avoids future instance usage, while an eligible RI Marketplace sale can transfer the remaining commitment; termination alone does not cancel RI payments.",
"Terminate unneeded running instances so no usage continues after the reservation expires, but this does not refund the reservation.|Amazon's retail shopping site is not the EC2 Reserved Instance Marketplace.|Eligible Standard reservations can be listed in the RI Marketplace, subject to account/listing restrictions and a buyer.|Closing an AWS account/subscription is not a general way to cancel reservation obligations.|Stopping alone does not end the reservation commitment and can leave storage/address charges; the workload is decommissioned.","ri", "Not all RIs can be sold (for example Convertible RIs), sale is not guaranteed, and outstanding commitment charges continue until transfer/expiry.")
R(515,"C","resilient","Hybrid file access","File Gateway caches active data locally while storing file objects in S3 through supported SMB/NFS interfaces.",
"A VPN provides connectivity, not the file-cache/object-storage bridge.|Remote FSx can expose SMB, but alone does not provide the described on-premises low-latency hot-data cache.|S3 File Gateway supplies the familiar file share with local caching and durable cloud backing.|A shipping device is a bulk migration mechanism, not an ongoing application file share/cache.","gateway", "A cache hit can be local; uncached reads still need the cloud path and cannot universally match local disk latency.")
R(519,"C","secure","IAM permission administration","An IAM group shares identity policies among IAM users without editing each user separately.",
"Unlimited access violates least privilege and individual bucket statements duplicate administration.|A script still manages many individual assignments rather than the shared group abstraction.|Add the relevant users to a group and attach the scoped S3 policy to that group.|IAM users are not members of roles; they may be authorized to assume roles instead.","groups")
